    "description": "Item Description:\n14+ Piece Collection of Fossils, Minerals, Crystals, Shells w/Beaded Trinket Box\nA small rock, mineral, crystal, fossil, and shell collection consisting of :\n1) 1.25\" long piece of white selenite, rounded on the edges;\n2) 2 pieces of brown aragonite crystal clusters, 1.5\" and 2\" long\n3) a broken-open crystal quartz geode, 3\" long, with vivid purple interior\n4) 4 small pieces of green-blue copper bearing mineral such as azurite, malachite, or chrysocolla\n5) a 1.5\" x1\" piece of quartz crystal tipped with yellow-orange brown, such as citrine quartz\n6) A 1\" wide blue grey agate geode\n7) a 1\" wide striped black white and grey agate geode\n8) a beach-weathered spiral shell fragment, 4\" long, grey and white\n9) a chunk of white hardened coral, 4\"x 3\"\n10) a 2\" x 1\" chunk of white brain coral\n11) a 1.5\" wide stripey agate geode in white, goldish tan and grey\n12) a small gold velvet bag\n13) a small cloth net champagne colored drawsring bag with a note about the mystical properties of silver topaz\n14) a red hexagonal box , beaded with red and black, with inset v shaped or heart shaped mirror tiles and gold rim. 2.5\"\nManufacturer/Markings:\nNone.\nDimensions (LxWxH):\nsee above.\nColor(s):\nsee above.\nCondition/Damage:\nthese are natural items.\nModel number, if applicable:\nnone\nWeight of item:\nLot weighs app. 1 lb 11 oz.\nUsed Items Disclaimer\nThis is a pre-owned item and is being sold \"AS IS \" If you have any questions concerning this item, feel free to contact us.\nWe describe our items to the best of our ability and try to incorporate as much research as possible with books andInternet, however, we are not experts in any field.\nEvery person has the opportunity to achieve his/her fullest potential and participate in and contribute to all aspects of life, and with your help, you are making dreams come true.\nGoodwill of Southeast Georgia, Thank you for your continued support!",
